Package: GeoPathSampleR
Title: Bayesian Reconstruction of Animal Trajectories
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Raphaël", "Nussbaumer", , "rafnuss@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8185-1020"))
Author: Raphaël Nussbaumer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Raphaël Nussbaumer <rafnuss@gmail.com>
Description: Reconstructs bird migration trajectories from stationary-period
    likelihood maps built with GeoPressureR. A Gibbs sampler combines
    residence-dependent departure, a ground-speed distribution conditional on
    movement, and a prior on cumulative route distance between long periods.
    Provides posterior stay summaries and sampling diagnostics.
